sentences.text:
To ensure that there is no further delay, we issue the following directions :-
(a) The Trial Court shall expedite the proceedings and conclude the trial preferably within one year from today;
(b) The State is directed to ensure that the trial progresses without obstruction or delay and all the parties shall co-operate for the expeditious disposal;

